Farrell portraying transformations of his character as he travels through a dream world.

14
01:14:52,173 --> 01:14:58,173
The film is Ledger's final performance; it was dedicated
to him and co-producer William Vince.

15
01:20:13,043 --> 01:20:19,043
Its world premiere was during the 62nd Cannes Film Festival, out of competition.

16
01:25:33,913 --> 01:25:39,913
