million in its worldwide theatrical release.

17
01:30:54,782 --> 01:31:00,782
It received mostly positive reviews from critics.

18
01:36:15,652 --> 01:36:21,652
It was nominated for two Academy Awards.

19
01:41:36,521 --> 01:41:42,521
The first was Best Art Direction with art directed by Dave Warren and Anastasia
Masaro, and set decorated by Caroline Smith; it lost to Avatar.

20
